      <title type="text">Minimal API Validation in .NET 8</title>
      <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Minimal API needs explicit validation. Here is the endpoint filter I use.</p>
<pre class="brush: csharp;">public sealed class ValidationFilter&lt;T&gt; : IEndpointFilter
{
    public async ValueTask&lt;object?&gt; InvokeAsync(EndpointFilterInvocationContext ctx, EndpointFilterDelegate next)
    {
        return await next(ctx);
    }
}</pre>
<p>The diagram below shows the pipeline.</p>
<p><img src="/image.axd?picture=/2025/03/pipeline.png" alt="Pipeline" /></p>
<ul><li>Fast</li><li>Testable</li></ul>]]></content>
